                                                "sense_id": "7cd83766-dd59-3457-a0bf-a8f330b1658b",
                                                "text": "Each comes in a carrying case that keeps the devices together with their accessories: the miniplug cable for your music or DVD player, for example, and the adapters for quarter-inch phono jacks and dual-pronged airplane armrest jacks."
                                            }
                                        ]
